<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>I set my default harvest to 2 locations.
Allows you to test your character's walking path.
 between two locations to harvest

Edit the macro as follows:

1. Edit the 1st line, use the cursor tool (absolutely) to select the 1st resource location.

2. Edit the 14th line, use the cursor tool (absolutely) to select the 2nd resource location.

3. Can add positions by yourself by copying the line

4. Your character will start harvesting.

*What you need to know*

1. Equip a mount

2. Objects should not be more than 1 screen distance to reduce walking errors. (resolution : 1920x1080)

TURN ON THE MACRO AND GO WHEN THE INVENTORY IS FILLED! THANK YOU all!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
